%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: S11_6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::StoryScene
  sentences:
  - text: Amelie opens the door for us and we walk in.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm surprised to see two people in the room. And so is Scarlet, it seems.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I thought it was supposed to be just her father in here?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Who's that next to him? An attendant?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Sitting across from a very stern looking, silver haired gentleman, is a
      calm looking guy with an aloof air about him.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What is the meaning of this.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet murmurs under her breath.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Why does she look so troubled?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I choose to stay silent and let Scarlet lead our next moves.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Her father and the guy turn their attention to us.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Ah, Scarlet, my daughter. There you are. We were just talking about you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He slightly furrows his brow and glances in my direction.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: But who's that?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I greet the light of the empire, Prince Amon. Greetings to you too, father.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Lady Scarlet, it's good to see you.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c4b2a190f3e4d5c6b7a8190a1b2c3d4, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The prince flashes us a friendly smile.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I would have completely fallen for that smile as well, but now that I know
      that that's Scarlet's ex, his demeanour just seems fake.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: And to whom do I owe the pleasure?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8c4b2a190f3e4d5c6b7a8190a1b2c3d4, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I panic for a second but then decide to copy what Scarlet did.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I greet the light of the empire and his grace. My name is {playerName}.
      I'ts a pleasure to meet you both.
    alternativeText: I greet the light of the empire and his grace. My name is Scarlet's
      guest. I'ts a pleasure to meet you both.
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Scarlet, this conversation is about your engagement, so it would be best
      to let your friend go home for now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a392817161514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: He just told me to get lost without speaking to me directly.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes, father.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: She turns around to me and quietly whispers.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Sorry, there's nothing else I can do right now. Just wait nearby for a
      moment.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c82936b944e581478f4d23ce326563a, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 3
      type: 0
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I nod and follow her instructions.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Looks like our plan isn't going as smoothly as we hoped.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9ffb627455adace4786cef9541e6c996, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ac11a2b3c4d5e6f708192a3b4c5d6e7f, type: 2}
